  "details": "On local test world, there are log outputs claiming to play untrusted URL but it is YouTube URL which should be registered as the trusted domains list. Additionally, while the log contained error about untrusted URL, video playback was normally started.\n\n```\n\nError      -  You are playing an untrusted URL (Domain: www.youtube.com) in a local world. If this URL is needed for the world to work, the domain needs to be added to the world's Video Player Allowed Domains list on the website.\n\n```",
